 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "APIMatchingSystem() starts empty. A path is \"/\" (the root) or \"/\" followed by one or more non-empty segments separated by single \"/\" with no trailing slash. registerPath(path, handler) stores handler for exactly that path, overwriting any earlier handler for it. matchPath(path) returns the handler of the registered path that is the longest segment-wise prefix of path (the path itself counts; \"/\" is a prefix of every path), or \"\" when no registered path is such a prefix.",
  "provenance": [
